Watching *Get Lamp *(which is a pretty neat documentary about interactive
fiction) inspired me to create this story, which itself is very loosely
based off a very old text written by teryrei.

http://mw.lojban.org/index.php/la_nu_lo_skami_mi_tavla

Set in the 1980's, it's about a kid and his computer, but there's really an
intentional deeper meaning relating to the frustration associated with
subordination.

.i mi'e la tsani mu'o

